		{"id":"f52c0b61ce5aac02","type":"text","text":"# SAP Joule / A2A Client\n\nExternal user-facing A2A client sends JSON-RPC messages and receives task/SSE updates.","x":520,"y":-760,"width":640,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e1e224df3eabf29c","type":"text","text":"# A2A 入口与协议层\n\n接收 SAP Joule/A2A 请求，建立 Agent Card、任务执行器和对外协议边界。\n\n**6 nodes**\n\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-main.py-ad934351|app/main.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-agent_executor.py-87c591ed|app/agent_executor.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/.well-known-agent.json-5ff06873|.well-known/agent.json]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-ord-agent.json-c5ba6438|app/ord/agent.json]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-ord-document-system-instance.json-11cb3c93|app/ord/document-system-instance.json]]","x":520,"y":-420,"width":640,"height":320,"color":"5"},
