		{"id":"deea515b8e3287ef","type":"text","text":"# 文档与治理层\n\n包含 README、AGENTS、规则、设计记录和审查文档，解释项目约束与协作方式。\n\n**18 nodes**\n\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/README.md-6e8b71dd|README.md]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/AGENTS.md-bcfeb4d9|AGENTS.md]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/docs-adr-ADR-001-hitl-ticket-pattern-and-known-limits.md-a4395e72|docs/adr/ADR-001-hitl-ticket-pattern-and-known-limits.md]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/.claude-CLAUDE.md-ed7ff6f9|.claude/CLAUDE.md]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/.claude-settings.json-718d9514|.claude/settings.json]]","x":-420,"y":100,"width":580,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ea7f83c5c6a804c8","type":"text","text":"# 评测与测试层\n\n覆盖 pytest、前端测试、Aeval 用例和回归场景，用于保护多轮代理行为。\n\n**267 nodes**\n\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/tests-changer-test_pending_cross_pod.py-095f50da|tests/changer/test_pending_cross_pod.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/tests-supervisor-test_in_process_dispatch.py-d06ecbd2|tests/supervisor/test_in_process_dispatch.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/aeval-configs-agent-config.yaml-598d344c|aeval/configs/agent-config.yaml]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/tests-plugins-test_mcp_data_access.py-4a9ac051|tests/plugins/test_mcp_data_access.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/tests-plugins-test_resolver.py-f645ef3b|tests/plugins/test_resolver.py]]","x":2100,"y":520,"width":580,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d87016596590b85d","type":"text","text":"# 专业 Agent 层\n\n包含 proposal 与 changer 等领域专家，以及它们共享的业务工具、后端适配和确认执行流程。\n\n**42 nodes**\n\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-proposal-agent.py-ef20cb87|app/proposal/agent.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-changer-agent.py-339dc8e2|app/changer/agent.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-proposal-types.py-1546c3a4|app/proposal/types.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-changer-types.py-6747f1fd|app/changer/types.py]]\n- [[Treasury Transaction Agent KG/Files/app-common-types.py-5fdf7621|app/common/types.py]]","x":520,"y":490,"width":640,"height":360,"color":"2"},
